            <summary>KEPServerEX 채널명 (예: "ModbusTCP")</summary>
        </member>
        <member name="P:DeviceConnector.Models.ESP32Data.DeviceName">
            <summary>KEPServerEX 디바이스명 (예: "ESP32_01")</summary>
        </member>
        <member name="P:DeviceConnector.Models.ESP32Data.PosX">
            <summary>X 좌표 (m) - Modbus 40001-40002 (Float)</summary>
        </member>
        <member name="P:DeviceConnector.Models.ESP32Data.PosY">
            <summary>Y 좌표 (m) - Modbus 40003-40004 (Float)</summary>
        </member>
        <member name="P:DeviceConnector.Models.ESP32Data.PosTheta">
            <summary>각도 Theta (rad) - Modbus 40005-40006 (Float)</summary>
        </member>
